# Airflow DAG-discovery ignore — scoped to this directory + subdirs.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# The platform Airflow scheduler's DAGS_FOLDER is the git-sync worktree root
# (/opt/airflow/dags-git/current); use-case-crypto.git is committed under a
# top-level `use-case-crypto/` dir, so this file lands at
# `current/use-case-crypto/.airflowignore` and scopes the recursive DAG scan to
# this subtree. Only `dags/` holds Airflow DAGs; every other subtree carries
# .py modules (services, pipelines, scripts) whose runtime deps are NOT in the
# apache/airflow image — import-probing them would raise spurious "Broken DAG"
# banners. Prune them. Patterns are regexes (Airflow default
# DAG_IGNORE_FILE_SYNTAX=regexp), matched against each path relative to here.
argocd/
manifests/
proto/
scripts/
services/
pipelines/
dbt/
docs/
config/
database/
notebooks/
